{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-p010a","title":"甄氏丧甄俨敬嫂劝母优待寡嫂","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-p010a-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"甄氏丧甄俨敬嫂劝母优待寡嫂","evidence":["houfei-e-p010a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0016","role":"劝母","evidence":["houfei-e-p010a-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0024","role":"卒","evidence":["houfei-e-p010a-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0022","role":"听劝","evidence":["houfei-e-p010a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"甄氏年十四","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-p010a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-p010a-q","source_order":[5,89,"P010a"],"order":1384},{"id":"houfei-e-o023c","title":"甄后母卒曹叡缌服临丧","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o023c-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"甄后母卒曹叡缌服临丧","evidence":["houfei-e-o023c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"临丧","evidence":["houfei-e-o023c-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0022","role":"卒","evidence":["houfei-e-o023c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":227,"label":"四月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y227","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o022","basis":"四月"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o023c-q","houfei-q-o022","mingdi-q-o004","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o023c-q","source_order":[5,96,"O023c"],"order":1394}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0022","name":"张氏（甄逸妻）","evidence":["houfei-q-p009"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-p009-houfei-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p009"]},{"id":"houfei-m-p010-houfei-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p010"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o023-houfei-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o023"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o025-houfei-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o025"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o023c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-726e392875bbc6d22fbc","layer":"original","quote":"四月，初营宗庙，掘地得玉玺；方一寸九分〖3〗，其文曰“天子羡思慈亲”〖4〗。明帝为之改容〖5〗，以太牢告庙，又尝梦见后；于是差次舅氏亲疏高下〖6〗，叙用各有差〖7〗；赏赐累巨万；以像为虎贲中郎将〖8〗。是月，后母薨，帝制缌服临丧〖9〗，百僚陪位。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-p010a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-acd5708678449fc13c24","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“后年十四，丧中兄俨，悲哀过制。事寡嫂谦敬，事处其劳。拊养俨子，慈爱甚笃。后母性严，待诸妇有常。后数谏母曰：‘兄不幸早终，嫂年少守节，顾留一子。以大义言之：待之当如妇，爱之宜如女。’母感后言，流涕，便令后与嫂共止。寝息坐起常相随，恩爱益密。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":88,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-00cdf08ac301438cca93","start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o022","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-31288da490b4d6270504","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年三月，以中山魏昌之安城乡户千〖2〗，追封逸，谥曰敬侯；嫡孙像，袭爵。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o023","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-726e392875bbc6d22fbc","layer":"original","quote":"四月，初营宗庙，掘地得玉玺；方一寸九分〖3〗，其文曰“天子羡思慈亲”〖4〗。明帝为之改容〖5〗，以太牢告庙，又尝梦见后；于是差次舅氏亲疏高下〖6〗，叙用各有差〖7〗；赏赐累巨万；以像为虎贲中郎将〖8〗。是月，后母薨，帝制缌服临丧〖9〗，百僚陪位。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p009","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-f5444ab8ae602f01c130","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“逸娶常山张氏，生三男五女：长男豫，早终；次俨，举孝廉，大将军掾，曲梁长；次尧，举孝廉；长女姜，次脱，次道，次荣，次即后。后以汉光和五年十二月丁酉生。每寝寐，家中仿佛见如有人持玉衣覆其上者，常共怪之。逸薨，加号慕，内外益奇之。后相者刘良，相后及诸子，良指后曰：‘此女贵乃不可言！’后自少至长，不好戏弄。年八岁，外有立骑马戏者，家人诸姊皆上阁观之；后独不行。诸姊怪问之，后答言：‘此岂女人之所观邪？’年九岁，喜书，视字辄识，数用诸兄笔砚。兄谓后言：‘汝当习女工。用书为学，当作女博士邪？’后答言：‘闻古者贤女，未有不学前世成败，以为己诫。不知书，何由见之？’”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-021d19b721b6c9edc251","start":0,"end":288,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p010","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-acd5708678449fc13c24","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“后年十四，丧中兄俨，悲哀过制。事寡嫂谦敬，事处其劳。拊养俨子，慈爱甚笃。后母性严，待诸妇有常。后数谏母曰：‘兄不幸早终，嫂年少守节，顾留一子。以大义言之：待之当如妇，爱之宜如女。’母感后言，流涕，便令后与嫂共止。寝息坐起常相随，恩爱益密。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":88,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-00cdf08ac301438cca93","start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
